      "id": "262:101",
      "characters": "For visitors and locals, Guild dining is a journey, an invitation to to savor our worlds. The Lobby Bar knows its classics from its off-menu surprises. California’s first Zuma serves up the sushi and robata that have made it an international standard-setter from London to Miami, Vail to Abu Dhabi. Poolside, there’s always fresh, easy West Coast goodness, and the Mediterranean influences daytime offerings in The Courtyard.   ",
